  ["Segment 0", "S0-S012-Water", "167.8 ft", "Big Walnut Creek", "Medium GIS crossing; bridge use unverified", "ODOT hydro OID 21956 / COMID 5213341; Morse Rd SFN 2530872 is a bridge candidate only.", "USACE Huntington Section 10/404 JD and NWP57; Ohio EPA if fill/discharge/isolated wetland; identify actual road/bridge owner (ODOT vs local) and local floodplain office.", "Franklin County Engineer: fracoeng@franklincountyengineer.org, 614-525-3030. ODOT utility contact Wendi Snyder: Wendi.Snyder@dot.ohio.gov, 614-728-8062 (only if state ROW/structure). Corps RRS; Ohio EPA James Morris: james.morris@epa.ohio.gov.", "Overlay route against Morse Rd structure; request bridge plans, channel survey, scour/floodway analysis, ROW and utility records; test HDD profile/pits outside banks/resources.", "Bridge inventory point does not confer attachment rights. Confirm structure owner and whether crossing is through/under/adjacent to bridge."],
